# Privacy Policy – English Bible & Reading Plan

This Privacy Policy applies to the **English Bible & Reading Plan** app (hereafter referred to as the “Application”) for mobile devices, created by Deepak P (hereafter referred to as the “Service Provider”). This Application is provided as a free service and is intended to be used “AS IS.”

## Information Collection and Use

The Application does not collect, store, or share any personally identifiable information.

It does not require or request any user permissions such as access to contacts, location, camera, microphone, or storage.

The Application functions as a Bible reading tool, allowing users to:

- Read Bible verses in English.
- Select books and chapters.
- Follow a structured 365-day Bible reading plan.
- Track their reading progress throughout the year.
- Mark completed reading days.
- Adjust font size for better readability.

All reading progress data is stored locally on the user's device. The Application does not collect or transmit this progress information to external servers.

## Children's Privacy

The Application does not knowingly collect any information from children under the age of 13.

Since the Application does not directly collect personal information, it is intended to be suitable for users of all age groups.

## Data Security

The Application does not collect or transmit personal user data. Reading progress and preferences are stored locally on the user's device.

The Service Provider takes user privacy seriously and aims to ensure that the Application operates offline, except for third-party services such as advertisements, if enabled through Google AdMob. Such services are subject to their respective privacy policies.

## Third-Party Services

If the Application displays advertisements through third-party advertising services such as Google AdMob, these services may independently collect certain information, including device identifiers and advertising-related data, in accordance with their own privacy policies.

You can review Google's Privacy Policy here:

https://policies.google.com/privacy

